{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>I will go down.</b> I will go down to the ultimate end of their wickedness — which is readiness to proceed from one evil to another — as in נֵרְדָה וְנָבְלָה שָׁם שְׂפָתָם (Genesis 11:7), as was explained above." "<b>And I will see — its outcry.</b> I will see this in actuality, through the disclosure of their heart when they rise up against Lot the well-intentioned, so that all who come into the world may know that the great punishment was not without cause." "<b>They have made an end.</b> All of them together act, with none among them objecting — as in כָּלָה גָרֵשׁ יְגָרֵשׁ (Exodus 11:1), which means 'all of you.' This too became known through the mission of the angels, of whom it says כָּל הָעָם מִקָּצֶה (Genesis 19:4) — and there was none to restrain them."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:38.346476284Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}